; The run's receipt. Reached only from the ending, and it hands off to the credits.
;
; The breakdown rows are NOT authored here: how many kinds of ore a run turned up is not
; something the scene can know, so extraction_report.gd builds them between Balance and
; Continue. That is why Continue is last, and why moving it would break the insert.

